# The Prince and the Hopper's edges: a level 75 Warrior in Mamook, the quest accepted at Prog 5 (GMs). Footprint1: the
# six popped; Prog 4 (a GM): the Poroggo Casanova killed: Prog not 5: no Prog change, the five despawned all the same;
# Footprint1 (shown by a GM) at Prog 4: 223 again, finished: Prog 5. Prog 7 (a GM) in Whitegate with a full bag:
# Maudaal 890, finished: the gorget does not fit: not completed; freed: 890: completed.
lists Mamook/Toads_Footprint1/onTrigger Mamook/Poroggo_Casanova/onMobDeath AhtUrhganWhitegate/Maudaal/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/890
char zone=Mamook pos=-41.3,5.968,-100.554 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.ThePrinceAndTheHopper accepted
charvar Quest[6][67]Prog 5
login
trigger Toads_Footprint1                # Prog 5: the six popped; IMPENDING_BATTLE
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[6][67]Prog 4              # a GM
kill POROGGO_CASANOVA                   # Prog 4: no change; the five despawned
tick 2000
npcstatus Toads_Footprint1 normal       # a GM: the footprint stays hidden after the kill
trigger Toads_Footprint1                # Prog 4: 223
finish                                  # Prog 5
charvar Quest[6][67]Prog 7              # a GM
warp -145.7,1.8,-3.121 AhtUrhganWhitegate
fill-inventory
trigger Maudaal                         # Prog 7: 890
finish                                  # the gorget does not fit: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Maudaal                         # 890
finish                                  # completed
